meta {
  name: LIST
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/mobileapps/pestisida?per_page=20&page=1
  body: none
  auth: none
}

params:query {
  per_page: 20
  page: 1
  q: ~
  komoditas: ~
  jenis_sasaran: ~
  type: ~
  target_type: ~
  sort: akhir_izin_desc
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

docs {
  Public paginated list of pesticide brands. One row per merek (not per sasaran) — each card carries a 1-line summary plus arrays of `komoditas_list` and `jenis_sasaran_list` so Flutter can render the brand card without a second call.

  **Query params:**
  - `per_page` (int, default 20, max 50)
  - `page` (int, default 1)
  - `q` (string, max 80) — matches merek, bahan aktif, or no. pendaftaran. **Case-insensitive** (sejak 2026-05-27): `q=agafena`, `q=AGAFENA`, `q=Agafena` semua match `AGAFENA 230 EC`. Cross-DB safe (Postgres prod + MySQL dev).
  - `komoditas` — substring match, **case-insensitive**, **multi-value** (sejak 2026-05-27). Accepts:
    - single: `?komoditas=cabai`
    - comma-separated: `?komoditas=cabai,padi,jagung`
    - array: `?komoditas[]=cabai&komoditas[]=padi`
    Logic is OR within column (returns rows matching *any* of the values).
  - `jenis_sasaran` — substring match, **case-insensitive**, **multi-value** (same formats + OR semantics as `komoditas`)
  - `type` (enum, **multi-value**, sejak 2026-05-27) — derived from `jenis_pestisida` prefix. Accepts single, comma-separated (`?type=insektisida,fungisida`), or array (`?type[]=insektisida&type[]=fungisida`). Valid keys: `insektisida`, `fungisida`, `herbisida`, `akarisida`, `rodentisida`, `nematisida`, `moluskisida`, `bakterisida`, `zpt`, `pupuk`, `lainnya`. Invalid keys return 422.
  - `target_type` (enum, **multi-value**, sejak 2026-05-27) — petani-facing grouping that rolls up `type` into broader buckets. Valid keys: `hama`, `penyakit`, `gulma`, `zat_pengatur`, `lainnya`. Single/comma/array forms all work. Mapping:
    - `hama` ⇐ insektisida + akarisida + rodentisida + nematisida + moluskisida
    - `penyakit` ⇐ fungisida + bakterisida
    - `gulma` ⇐ herbisida
    - `zat_pengatur` ⇐ zpt + pupuk
    - `lainnya` ⇐ pesticide type `lainnya`
    Invalid keys return 422. Use this for the top-level Hama / Penyakit / Gulma tab in the mobile UI.
  - When `komoditas`, `jenis_sasaran`, `type`, and `target_type` are sent together they're AND'd across columns (each column's values OR'd internally).
  - `sort` (enum, default `akhir_izin_desc`) — one of `akhir_izin_desc`, `akhir_izin_asc`, `nama_asc`, `nama_desc`

  **Response field `type` (sejak 2026-05-27):** Every row in `data[]` includes a derived `type` field (same enum as above) alongside the verbose `jenis_pestisida`. Use `type` for chip filters / icons; show `jenis_pestisida` for the full label.

  **Response field `target_types[]` (sejak 2026-05-27):** Every card includes a `target_types` array — the union of `target_type` values across that merek's sasaran rows. Most cards have a single entry (e.g. `["hama"]`), but combo products can have multiple (e.g. `["hama", "penyakit"]`). Use this to render Hama/Penyakit/Gulma badges on the card.
}

example {
  name: List: First page

  request: {
    url: {{baseUrl}}/mobileapps/pestisida?per_page=20&page=1
    method: GET
    mode: none
    headers: {
      Accept: application/json
    }
  }

  response: {
    headers: {
      content-type: application/json; charset=utf-8
    }

    status: {
      code: 200
      text: OK
    }

    body: {
      type: json
      content: '''
        {
          "success": true,
          "message": "List pestisida",
          "data": {
            "snapshot_date": "2026-05-26",
            "current_page": 1,
            "last_page": 300,
            "per_page": 20,
            "total": 5991,
            "data": [
              {
                "merek_id": 98,
                "merek_pestisida": "AGAFENA 230 EC",
                "bahan_aktif": "abamektin (abamectin): 30 g/l klorfenapir (chlorfenapyr): 200 g/l",
                "jenis_pestisida": "Insektisida racun kontak dan lambung berbentuk pekatan yang dapat diemulsikan",
                "type": "insektisida",
                "target_types": ["hama"],
                "pemegang_pendaftaran": "PT Agro Guna Makmur",
                "nomor_pendaftaran": "RI. 01010120155286",
                "tanggal_akhir_izin": "20 Januari 2031",
                "komoditas_list": ["Cabai"],
                "jenis_sasaran_list": ["hama trips"],
                "sasaran_count": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      '''
    }
  }
}

example {
  name: List: Filter by type

  request: {
    url: {{baseUrl}}/mobileapps/pestisida?type=insektisida,fungisida&per_page=2
    method: GET
    mode: none
    headers: {
      Accept: application/json
    }
  }

  response: {
    headers: {
      content-type: application/json; charset=utf-8
    }

    status: {
      code: 200
      text: OK
    }

    body: {
      type: json
      content: '''
        {
          "success": true,
          "message": "List pestisida",
          "data": {
            "snapshot_date": "2026-05-26",
            "current_page": 1,
            "last_page": 1534,
            "per_page": 2,
            "total": 3068,
            "data": [
              { "merek_id": 98, "merek_pestisida": "AGAFENA 230 EC", "type": "insektisida", "jenis_pestisida": "Insektisida racun kontak…", "sasaran_count": 1 },
              { "merek_id": 12, "merek_pestisida": "AMISTAR 250 SC", "type": "fungisida", "jenis_pestisida": "Fungisida sistemik…", "sasaran_count": 2 }
            ]
          }
        }
      '''
    }
  }
}

